- `cargo check --workspace` ✅ — clean build
- `cargo test -p polkagent-service -- metadata_watcher` ✅ — all 6 new tests pass
- `cargo test -p polkagent-core -p polkagent-event -p polkagent-telemetry` ✅ — all 89 tests pass
